{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_15992","headline":"七夕曲 · 王建","name":"七夕曲","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"河边独自看星宿，夜织天丝难接续。\n抛梭振镊动明璫，爲有秋期眠不足。\n遥愁今夜河水隔，龙驾车辕鹊填石。\n流苏翠帐星渚间，环佩无声灯寂寂。\n两情缠绵忽如故，复畏秋风生晓路。\n幸回郎意且斯须，一年中别今始初，明星未出少停车。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王建","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_15992.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_15992","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}